   "where": "Table 2 caption",
   "quote": "Table 2: Results on the MedPhysBench v1.0 test split. Calculation: share of the 600 items (300 for models marked † \\dagger , which answered a pre-specified stratified half) within tolerance and in a correct unit, with its exact 95% interval; in parentheses, the share among responses that were not blocked, interrupted or truncated. L3: level-3 items (%). Checking: planted errors detected (Det.), false alarms on correct calculations (FA), both in percent, and Youden’s J J = Det. − - FA; 150 planted and 150 correct items per format (75 and 75 for † \\dagger ), all items included ( Section 5 ); a response without a parsable verdict counts as a miss on a planted error and as neither a false alarm nor an acceptance on a correct calculation ( Table 10 ). Intervals for every checking metric are in Appendix F . Cost: US dollars for the run.",
